This section is a Preset candidate and does not establish project Authority.
Only content explicitly adopted into repository-local Product, SSoT, Standards,
ADRs, contracts, or agent instructions becomes current; source, lockfiles, and
executed Evidence answer their own questions.

## Knowledge Surfaces

- `docs/README.md`, when present, indexes project Authority by question and artifact.
- The current question, code area, artifact, owner, or direct Evidence may be an entry.
- App/package/module READMEs and local `AGENTS.md` describe only real local deltas.
- Portable Skill output paths are candidate defaults; existing project Current Homes win.

## Candidate Working Rules

- Reuse canonical project terms.
- Respect public/wiring and fact-writer boundaries.
- Prefer existing Harness surfaces and formal commands/queries.
- Report observations, supported conclusions, and unproven surfaces separately.

